#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Leaving a review"
msgstr "Оставяне на отзив"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Let's book a house!"
msgstr "Да резервираме къща!"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your accounting easier than ever with a completely integrated "
"environment i<font class=\"text-o-color-5\">n </font>\n"
"            <strong>\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">Accounting App</font>\n"
"            </strong>\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"
msgstr ""
"Управлявайте счетоводството си по-лесно от всякога в напълно интегрирана "
"среда в<font class=\"text-o-color-5\"> </font>\n"
"            <strong>\n"
"                <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">приложението „Счетоводство“</"
"font>\n"
"            </strong>\n"
"            <font class=\"text-o-color-5\">.</font>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Manage your customers from the <strong>Contact App</strong>"
msgstr "Управлявайте клиентите си от <strong>приложението „Контакти“</strong>"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing scarcity with availability"
msgstr "Управление на ограничения ресурс чрез наличността"

#. module: holiday_house
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:holiday_house.welcome_article_body
msgid "Managing your businesses"
msgstr "Управление на бизнеса ви"

